{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：22:00 2026-10-20 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"8旬邵氏打星江島罕露面曝光近況   多次合作劉家良拍逾兩百部電影  因身材魁梧成御用反派\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0913fc8d0b2061c8e33dc0a5ed0d3966/2026-10/KF_50.jpg\"/>\n<p>年過8旬的邵氏老牌打星江島久未露面，近日有網民在商場驚喜偶遇，並將影片分享至社交平台，引發一波懷舊熱潮。與江島同場的還見到有同邵氏工作的邵音音，兩位老戲骨罕見同框，勾起不少人回憶。</p>\n<h2>江島精神奕奕</h2>\n<p>當年是邵氏功夫片常客，亦擔任動作指導的江島，已鮮少在幕前演出。從網民曝光的影片所見，身體硬朗的江島，外表年輕，精神極好，身穿一件色彩斑斕、帶有貓王與電影膠卷圖案的印花襯衫，搭配牛仔褲，打扮相當時髦新潮，完全不像一位八旬長者。江島面對鏡頭時面帶微笑，又親切地豎起大拇指，盡顯老頑童本色。</p>\n<img alt=\"江島是邵氏老牌打星。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f0c3d51ab3b3ec07685d141d5a9d75fb/2026-10/kong_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江島曾擔任動作指導。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/333bb41d1be270ce176f7908701499e4/2026-10/kong_1_.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"江島60年代進入影壇。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f9a407ceb7c0b7bbab03c20cda82734d/2026-10/kong_2__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江島因為身材魁梧又五官突出，多度飾演反派角色。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/46d6eeed415c47d35f892ae9ff2af8c2/2026-10/kong_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江島拍攝逾兩百部電影。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d25c0934aca536c8f0246a0a646b4513/2026-10/kong_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江島近日在商場被捕獲，同場仲見到邵音音。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8306570101d7258f554f1e7a8c0d89bc/2026-10/cap_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江島與邵音音同為邵氏影星。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/37e844f460c6a600754fc4c9a1075208/2026-10/cap_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江島與邵音音難得碰頭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e9b1ffa3c9259b33d2f44dc2509f7a1c/2026-10/cap_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江島精神不俗。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27d17a1ecb7b604962b2ac8614dd54c7/2026-10/cap_5__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有粉絲帶同江島的舊照出現。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/154484a595bdd5777b2039004200ba3a/2026-10/cap_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江島穿搭新潮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/687b1cc7da6be8eab64b70c87e1c2928/2026-10/cap_10__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江島外表年輕，完全不像一位八旬長者。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9da9cf7d7c144ba0b276c87f4ddf6f83/2026-10/cap_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江島演出不少武打片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/90ea5f044c24127507cbb1069fb573a8/2026-10/kong_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江島70年代拍攝不少武打電影。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d2403d93586ee5bd320643258e1df7b5/2026-10/kong_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江島拍過不系作品。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d124bd408e598eb914c516d661d6c4e4/2026-10/kong_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江島演出多部電影。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e67d5966a9ff973c8a93bd980d460128/2026-10/kong_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江島加盟邵氏成為旗下的武打演員。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0362ceb0699769d79ec201e24d9c795c/2026-10/kong_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江島多度與張徹、劉家良合作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/68d060e6d815d06376b0cc82b32b11e9/2026-10/kong_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江島60年代進入影壇。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1c9a0ceafa7be65f19f254f7d656af9a/2026-10/kong_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江島曾與姜大衛、狄龍合作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc151410df2e88d12cfff8ae7503cb39/2026-10/kong_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江島曾演出2019年戰爭片《楊靖宇》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/00bcb0fb26a6a5046ca92fc564203d74/2026-10/kong_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江島在電影行業做出不少貢獻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b99b73431aeb031761feaa9634a48ff0/2026-10/kong_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江島是功夫片的熟面孔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a7dd1d7f243f999e3eeec93b66df42ba/2026-10/kong_19_.jpg\"/>\n<p>江島原名丁順源60年代進入影壇，第一部電影是黑白文藝片《大某小姨》（又名《秋霜女人心》）。江島曾多次跟台灣著名導演郭南宏合作，演出《盲女勾魂劍》、《鬼門太極》、《五鬼奪魂》等功夫片。到70年代江島從台灣來香港發展，參演嘉禾的《奪命金劍》，之後加盟邵氏成為旗下的武打演員。</p>\n<h2>江島多演反派角色</h2>\n<p>由於江島身材魁梧又五官突出，多度飾演反派角色，江島在陳觀泰主演的《馬永貞》姊妹篇《仇連環》露面，其後演出《五虎將》、《刺馬》、《大刀王五》、《少林子弟》、《少林五祖》、《洪拳與詠春》、《洪熙官》、《陸阿采與黃飛鴻》、《少林搭棚大師》等大量張徹電影，同時也有與劉家良多次合作，拍攝逾兩百部電影。</p>\n<img alt=\"邵音音拍過不少艷情片，如：《財子名花星媽》、《官人我要》等。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0467041fe0be0968d5471d429a4222a9/2023-08/123_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"邵音音獲獎無數，演技備受肯定。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c41fe2135f42d31ed40f3130258e6589/2026-05/Susan_66_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"邵音音曾在社交媒體透露被賊人開門爆竊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/eae74ebab8a3f368b027f05813cf66a0/2023-11/01_20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"邵音音不時邀請朋友到家中聚會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c5c23a7b77484cf40cb92f180c8fbe4/2024-02/428331994_10229171550304861_1762282031514972752_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"邵音音屋企好大。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d11284851618e01afc16681b662ae537/2024-02/428597346_10229171550184858_5299443674689859412_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"邵音音近日在IG分享屋企相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/95e0c751910405c508eea1e185e62582/2026-05/Susan_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"邵音音的孫兒也有出鏡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d1e00323dbda577b73cb6171751f560a/2026-05/Susan_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"邵音音屋企變成兒童樂圈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e77e1494821badc11875128f0b2b8cf/2026-05/Susan_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃夏蕙到訪邵音音家中。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9baa2ddc8422f6a29fc774f0a0af77e0/2026-05/Susan_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"邵音音位於大埔的豪宅目測最少有兩層高。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/06df83e8eb593183c865f357ae2c08bb/2026-05/Susan_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"邵音音女婿波多野裕介（左二）曾拍節目《尋找家香情》公開外母家居。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3b2be10adf395791a4471dcf1b006815/2026-05/Susan_68_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"客廳陳設。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/648929f057dbcf97d4b002450a094f48/2026-05/Susan_71_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"巨型深木色飾物櫃佔據整幅牆壁。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7b5cff58a4bdcb1063eb6fd3a064f621/2026-05/Susan_70_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"邵音音每間屋都有麻雀枱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d551aa520047bbd36b53ecb81291048d/2026-05/Susan_69_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"估計仲有天台。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d3e0280b6d1968378bdab0c4fa03f31/2026-05/_2018021515573390079.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"邵音音搞笑指慶幸外孫的尿片沒被偷走。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/96790c98a7d0490075e4d9da09abf5c6/2024-02/S1_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"邵音音數年前曾公開位於九龍塘逾3000呎豪宅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f846e3ba92197b6bff75c14ae4b7aa69/2026-05/Susan_19_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"邵音音九龍塘的3000呎豪宅，淨計客廳大過不少人間屋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/792dacf70ff15f99c7e970dc9fcdd044/2026-05/Susan_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"飯枱靠近門口。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/34a7fb3b47a923e8bb0179b2bb647f4c/2026-05/Susan_22_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有麻雀枱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d383c94a70d484af9b2ba92331250e11/2026-05/Susan_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"客廳好大。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b8a9c554d6839f843c23447dbfb2e3b3/2026-05/Susan_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"露台外的風景。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/556bccef011291767c057fefb01e9567/2026-05/Susan_25_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廚房都好大。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1d5ec7a48e3037076458577cfe7af668/2026-05/Susan_27_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"客廳中西合壁。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fc31db5b647b7b623fb98382586ea96d/2026-05/Susan_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"擺放邵音音的獎座。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/22b5168c967512220f741df958c2cdbc/2026-05/Susan_39_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"擺設被指有旺家居。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bb634fd05d4a97f31a638f52c6249605/2026-05/Susan_43_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有大電視。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a1686759d943b80afdc123c55c69c19a/2026-05/Susan_47_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"電視櫃旁的擺設同樣被指跟風水有關。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f64537ff053c949efb6d600a88658a11/2026-05/Susan_48_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"種有盆栽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/55a89304b61b461fb3b0cbd06d94c294/2026-05/Susan_50_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"邵音音的睡房。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3cc776bc308f477aa5ce0276589e7c6d/2026-05/Susan_55_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"邵音音睡房內有夾萬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/88e8e32bae295761e2c51689f24a1e42/2026-05/Susan_58_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T14:20:19.012987+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":558,"images":55,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T14:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T15:17:48.282885+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T14:17:44.813038+00:00","content_hash":"f8fd181209b322424ad31e1c843747c930cd4db70e06fafb45b2f4ed0f96c948","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}